          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Rabbigu Muuse kula hadlay bannaankii dalka Moo'aab oo Webi Urdun u dhowaa ee Yerixoo ka soo hor jeeday, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer binu Israa'iil la hadal, oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Markaad Webi Urdun gudubtaan oo aad dalka Kancaan gashaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waa inaad dadka dalka deggan oo dhan hortiinna ka eridaan, oo aad dhagaxyadooda sawirrada ah oo dhan wada baabbi'isaan, oo aad sanamyadooda la shubay oo dhan wada burburisaan, oo aad meelahooda sarsare oo dhan wada dumisaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaas waa inaad dalka hanti ahaan u qaadataan oo aad iska dhex degtaan; waayo, dalka idinkaan idin siiyey inaad lahaataan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dalka waa inaad qabiil qabiil saami ugu dhaxashaan. Inta badan waxaad siisaan dhaxalka badan, oo inta yarna waxaad siisaan dhaxalka yar. Oo meel alla meeshii nin saami ugu dhaco halkaas isagaa iska lahaanaya, oo sida qabiilooyinkii awowayaashiin yihiin waa inaad u dhaxashaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse haddaydnan dadka dalka deggan hortiinna ka eryin, markaas kuwii aad daysaan waxay idinku noqon doonaan sidii wax indhihiinna muda, iyo sidii qodxan dhinacyada idinkaga jira, oo waxay idinku dhibi doonaan dalka aad deggan tihiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidii aan ku talo galay inaan iyaga ku sameeyo ayaan idinka idinku samayn doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.56"
            ]
          }
        }
